  "bodyHtml": "<!--fb-gallery--><div class=\"is-container-in\"><div class=\"remote-row clearfix\"><div class=\"column full\"><h1 class=\"size-48 is-title1-48 is-title-bold\">說說「優雅」</h1></div></div><div class=\"remote-row clearfix\"><div class=\"column half\"><p class=\"normal-txt\"><span style=\"font-size:22px;\">獵豹老師的優雅是「形而上」：觀念的的優雅 觀點的卓越</span></p><p class=\"normal-txt\"><span style=\"font-size:22px;\">我這呼應一下 「形而下」的優雅 ：體力活的減輕 汗水少流些</span></p><p class=\"normal-txt\"><span style=\"font-size:22px;\">前幾年武陵高中科學班入學考 ，考完後</span></p><p class=\"normal-txt\"><span style=\"font-size:22px;\">一位學生很高興的來找我 說：老師 你猜中一題 讓我秒殺！</span></p><p class=\"normal-txt\"><span style=\"font-size:22px;\">我：哦 那道題？</span></p><p class=\"normal-txt\"><span style=\"font-size:22px;\">他拿出計算紙秀了題目（Fig1）</span></p><p class=\"normal-txt\"><span style=\"font-size:22px;\">我：誒 我沒講這題啊</span></p><p class=\"normal-txt\"><span style=\"font-size:22px;\">學生：你前幾天考前講座不是上了這題嗎（Fig2）</span></p><p class=\"normal-txt\"><span style=\"font-size:22px;\">你是這樣解的！（Fig3）</span></p><p class=\"normal-txt\"><span style=\"font-size:22px;\">所以我這樣解：（Fig4）</span></p><p class=\"normal-txt\"><span style=\"font-size:22px;\">聰明的孩子！</span></p><p class=\"normal-txt\"><span style=\"font-size:22px;\">註：武陵這題是1983.AHSME-P23</span></p><p class=\"normal-txt\"><span style=\"font-size:22px;\">(Fig5)是一般常規的作法</span></p></div></div><div class=\"remote-row clearfix\"><div class=\"column full\"><img src=\"pic/columns/cheetah-salon-721244105494944-1.jpg\" alt=\"說說「優雅」\"></div></div><div class=\"remote-row clearfix\"><div class=\"column full\"><img src=\"pic/columns/cheetah-salon-721244105494944-2.jpg\" alt=\"說說「優雅」\"></div></div><div class=\"remote-row clearfix\"><div class=\"column full\"><img src=\"pic/columns/cheetah-salon-721244105494944-3.jpg\" alt=\"說說「優雅」\"></div></div><div class=\"remote-row clearfix\"><div class=\"column full\"><img src=\"pic/columns/cheetah-salon-721244105494944-4.jpg\" alt=\"說說「優雅」\"></div></div><div class=\"remote-row clearfix